-          [<c008ad2c>] print_circular_bug+0x70/0x2c4
-          [<c008c08c>] validate_chain+0x1034/0x10bc
-          [<c008c660>] __lock_acquire+0x54c/0xba4
-          [<c008d240>] lock_acquire+0xa4/0x114
